    "http_display": "Both export links use text/plain; charset=utf-8 and Content-Disposition: inline; all-config JSONL URL remains unchanged",
    "single_output": "Each scope has its own persistent round shared by clients of that scope; new arrivals join next round; global URLs and existing position preserved",
    "source_output": "Source membership is filtered before identity ranking; each source has scoped full JSONL and single-config rotation, independent of every other source and global rotation",
    "mixed_input": "Extract plain URIs, full JSON/JSONL, standalone and embedded Base64 blocks, wrapped standard/URL-safe encodings; exact original response and decoded payload bytes remain immutable. URL path case is preserved.",
    "balanced_template": "Explicit universal balancer route retains original pool, strategy, fallback, observer and necessary chain tags; collision-free common envelope helpers; no arbitrary server selection",
    "traffic": "SOCKS UDP and tcp,udp routing; Vision/Mux UDP443 gates open. No unsolicited Mux: explicit VLESS xudp input maps to UDP-only manager; upstream UDP/QUIC support remains separate.",
    "uri_compatibility": "Narrow userinfo space escaping preserves decoded credentials; TLS cs maps exactly; explicit VLESS packetEncoding=xudp uses one UDP stream with TCP multiplexing disabled. Missing REALITY keys remain explicit failures.",
    "smart_output": "Additional cached smart-parallel-v6b profiles: configurable member count, source/member least-use counters, random followers, one unique canonical first position per durable round; ordinary/source exports unchanged.",
    "smart_envelope": "Smart v5: complete member outbounds preserved except namespace references; logs off; leastPing burst10s/1/3s, block fallback, SOCKS/TUN DNS, proxy-routed non-IP DNS, exact endpoint-only bootstrap. Explicitly supersedes P15 fixed globals under renewed performance request.",
    "smart_admission": "Fresh source-owned https_multi_site_verified: two public HTTPS destinations plus TLS-valid Instagram homepage200/206. Ordinary core-valid output and base connection status unchanged. TTL-bounded; no persistent bank; not a claim about app media/carriers or every nested balanced outbound.",
    "smart_single": "Durable finite round over ready eligible cache only; skip rebuilding/revoked entries, next round when drained, new ready heads join next round. HTTP200 one inline JSON; no ready503 message+Retry-After; HEAD/prefetch nonconsuming.",
    "acquisition": "HTTP/extraction, current source ownership, core-valid output and connectivity are separate. Deletion-suppressed inputs are not ordinary duplicates or successful storage. Explicit source recovery clears only matching retained-response deletion controls, fences old jobs and requires fresh collection/validation."
